&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day performance of active touring shows from booking through post-event&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate cross-functional execution across Client Success, Marketing, Product, Operations, Finance, and Business Operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor concert lifecycle health and proactively identify opportunities or risks impacting show performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clients &amp;amp; promoters receive consistent communication and support throughout the touring lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onsale Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate onsale readiness across internal and external stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support promoters and venue partners before, during, and after onsales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track onsale performance and document learnings to improve future events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with onsite support for key events and strategic client meetings as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
