&lt;li&gt;Maintain visibility into the touring pipeline and active show portfolio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare recurring performance dashboards, client updates, and executive reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze historical performance to identify operational improvements and emerging trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
