&lt;li&gt;Serve as a day-to-day contact for promoters, venue partners, and other stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate client meetings, business reviews, and roadshows in support of the touring dept lead&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate strategic issues while independently resolving operational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build strong, trusted relationships through responsive service and operational excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
