&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SeatGeek believes live events are powerful experiences that unite humans. With our technological savvy and fan-first attitude we’re simplifying and modernizing the ticketing industry. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SeatGeek is looking for a Senior Associate to help scale our paid media efforts across TV, CTV, Audio, Display and other digital channels. This person will play a key role in strategy, execution, and measurement of our paid media programs, helping SeatGeek reach new audiences and drive incremental growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with internal teams, agencies, and media partners to translate business priorities into thoughtful media plans, evaluate what’s working, and identify opportunities to optimize and scale our investments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Media Strategy &amp;amp; Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help develop SeatGeek’s strategy across video (linear TV, DRTV, CTV, streaming), audio (streaming, radio), Display, YouTube, and other emerging channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the role of different channels, partners, networks, and inventory types within the broader media mix&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Test new channels, formats, publishers, and inventory to uncover scalable growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Campaign Management &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support day-to-day management of campaigns on Display, DRTV, CTV, Audio, and other assigned channels from planning through launch and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with agencies and media vendors to develop recommendations, manage campaign setup, and ensure campaigns launch on time and deliver in full&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pressure test assumptions around audiences, budgets, reach/frequency, inventory, and measurement approaches, providing thoughtful feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor campaign delivery and performance and identify opportunities for in-flight optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage select campaigns directly within buying platforms, including campaign setup, targeting, pacing, optimizations, and reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain budget trackers and support media invoicing and reconciliation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measurement &amp;amp; Testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build and execute a testing roadmap designed to answer questions about channel effectiveness, audiences, creative, frequency, and more&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal analytics teams to evaluate performance using incrementality testing, attribution, and other measurement approaches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply learnings across campaigns to continuously improve SeatGeek’s media strategy and investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain monthly and ad hoc reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Creative, Analytics, and other marketing teams to support planning, execution, and measurement of paid media channels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with agency, platform, publisher, and measurement partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree and 4+ years of experience in media planning, buying, performance marketing, integrated marketing, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with at least two of the following channels: DRTV, CTV, Audio, Display, Online Video, or other paid media formats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of media planning fundamentals, including audience strategy, reach and frequency, flighting, inventory, and budget allocation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with media agencies and/or directly with publishers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills and an interest in sophisticated measurement approaches, particularly incrementality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A performance-oriented mindset and ability to use data to make recommendations about where and how to invest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple campaigns, partners, timelines, and priorities simultaneously&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills and comfortable working with a range of stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive and curious approach; you’re excited to dig into how media works, challenge assumptions, and identify opportunities to improve performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
