&lt;li&gt;Build powerful and performant tools and integrations between systems that generate efficiency for teams across the business, leveraging AI in the most impactful places&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide / steer non-technical users towards greater building capabilities with increasingly robust system architecture + feature sets&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate new technologies and improve our software stack to keep our technological edge. Ensure our stack of AI tools is maximized for effectiveness + impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across team and discipline boundaries to develop the best product in our industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
