&lt;li&gt;Work closely with a cross-functional team of product managers and engineers to deliver high quality and easy to designs that solve real problems and drive long-term business value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively participate in experience reviews to refine and improve the quality of your work and the work of the entire user experience team&lt;/li&gt;
